What I understood you are asking for:
1. "determine which TFs bind DNA together as heterodimers" -- not available here: no registered workflow produces this. PANDA does not give it: the PPI network is an input of possible TF cooperation. PANDA refines a cooperativity matrix internally, but the executor does not save it, and it is not a measurement of physical complexes or stoichiometry.

No registered workflow produces this, so none is offered as the way to get it.

